  "goodToKnow": "Der Verteidiger (die Verteidigerin) is a defender in sport (der Innenverteidiger, centre back) and a defence lawyer in criminal court. Der Pflichtverteidiger is a court-appointed defence lawyer. Verteidigen means to defend, and die Verteidigung is defence, as in das Bundesministerium der Verteidigung. In civil cases, a lawyer is simply der Anwalt. The plural is the same."
